      "updated": 1794000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SignOut fences repository work, then clears the local Firestore cache. Remote documents stay intact.\nSessionStores clears navigation and root saved state on sign-out or account change. A caregiver who has joined a circle\nstarts on Whose care. Notification preferences (US-37) are drawn in the Reminders diagram.\nWhen the role can't be read at startup, AccountCheckScreen offers Retry, or \"Use another account\" through SignOut.",
      "originalText": "SignOut fences repository work, then clears the local Firestore cache. Remote documents stay intact.\nSessionStores clears navigation and root saved state on sign-out or account change. A caregiver who has joined a circle\nstarts on Whose care. Notification preferences (US-37) are drawn in the Reminders diagram.\nWhen the role can't be read at startup, AccountCheckScreen offers Retry, or \"Use another account\" through SignOut.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
